stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> VehicleOff

    VehicleOff: BATT+ and 3.3 V AON present<br/>Main system rails off
    VehicleOff --> Boot: ACC_OK

    Boot: Enable TPS552892-Q1<br/>Wait for 5V_SYS_GOOD
    Boot --> Sequence: Main 3.3 V and 1.8 V valid

    Sequence: RP2354 starts with<br/>branch enables low
    Sequence --> Running: Display, touch, USB, camera,<br/>backlight and audio enabled deliberately

    Running --> LoadShed: Low input voltage or crank policy
    LoadShed: Mute amplifier<br/>Disable backlight, USB VBUS, camera<br/>Preserve CM5 where possible
    LoadShed --> Running: Rail margin restored

    Running --> Shutdown: ACC removed
    Shutdown: Request orderly CM5 shutdown<br/>Disable external and high-load branches
    Shutdown --> VehicleOff: SYS_HOLD released or timeout
